            <note corresp="#d421-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d421-f1-content">
                <p>Drafted by Fessenden; cleared by
                        Merchant and Bowie. Repeated to London, Brussels, The
                    Hague, Rome, Luxembourg, and Bonn.</p>
            </note>
